{"id":"a548cb5c1ed94888","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-quantifier-language.md","title":"Finite Generalized-Quantifier Syntax and Semantics","display":"df-quantifier-language — Finite Generalized-Quantifier Syntax and Semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-quantifier-language","aliases":["67-df-quantifier-language"],"display":"df-quantifier-language — Finite Generalized-Quantifier Syntax and Semantics","depends_on":["[[67-df-generalized-quantifier]]","[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-satisfaction]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-abstract-logic]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-quantifier-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-quantifier-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-language — Finite Generalized-Quantifier Syntax and Semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a5df6cf30c97026\" href=\"?note=1a5df6cf30c97026\" title=\"67-df-generalized-quantifier\">67-df-generalized-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}\">\\(I=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>，固定类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n_i=\\langle n_{i,j}\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\">\\(\\vec n_i=\\langle n_{i,j}\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_i\\ge1\">\\(m_i\\ge1\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_i\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n_i}\">\\(Q_i\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n_i}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是一阶签名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i})\">\\(\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i})\\)</span> 是标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"8\">\\(8\\)</span>、记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>、每个绑定表和每个子公式的有限树节点；其节点类型区别于一阶语法。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_{i,j}}\">\\(\\vec x_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_{i,j}}\\)</span> 均各异。</li>\n<li>下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}\\)</span>、自由变量、句子及满足关系。原子、否定、合取、全称量词的语义递归与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a> 完全相同，但递归子式取扩展公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{L(\\vec Q)}\">\\(g_{L(\\vec Q)}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的树编码并按下式增加标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"8\">\\(8\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_L\">\\(g_L\\)</span> 的旧节点代码不变。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 是相应未加外层类型标签的树编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{idx}(v_k)=k\">\\(\\operatorname{idx}(v_k)=k\\)</span>。有效编码部分仅用于有限 PR 可编码签名，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_i\">\\(Q_i\\)</span> 的语义可计算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}\\)</span> 在任意签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 上使用下式的句子与满足关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i})&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle8,i,\\langle(\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\rangle,\\\\\nY_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Atom}_L,\\\\\nY_{h+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Y_h\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in Y_h\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in Y_h\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in Y_h\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i}):i\\in I\\land\n\\langle\\vec x_j\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\in\\prod_{j&lt;m_i}\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_{i,j}}\\land\\vec\\varphi\\in Y_h^{m_i}\n\\land\\forall j&lt;m_i\\ \\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x_j)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{h\\in\\mathbb N}Y_h,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Atom}_L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i}))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{j&lt;m_i}\\bigl(\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi_j)\\setminus\\{x_{j,k}:k&lt;n_{i,j}\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}:\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\alpha&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Atom}_L),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto a]\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i})&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ_i^{|\\mathfrak M|}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\{\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{n_{i,j}}:\n\\mathfrak M,s[\\vec x_j\\mapsto\\vec a]\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi_j\\}\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\right)=1,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\theta&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\theta)\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)}),\\\\\nu(\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i}))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle8,i,\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle\\operatorname{idx}(x_{j,k})\\rangle_{k&lt;n_{i,j}}),u(\\varphi_j)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\right)\\right\\rangle\\right),\\\\\ng_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq u(\\varphi)\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}}(L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)},\n&amp;\\models_{\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q},L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i})&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle8,i,\\langle(\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\rangle,\\\\\nY_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Atom}_L,\\\\\nY_{h+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Y_h\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in Y_h\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in Y_h\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in Y_h\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i}):i\\in I\\land\n\\langle\\vec x_j\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\in\\prod_{j&lt;m_i}\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_{i,j}}\\land\\vec\\varphi\\in Y_h^{m_i}\n\\land\\forall j&lt;m_i\\ \\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x_j)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{h\\in\\mathbb N}Y_h,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Atom}_L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i}))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{j&lt;m_i}\\bigl(\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi_j)\\setminus\\{x_{j,k}:k&lt;n_{i,j}\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}:\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\alpha&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Atom}_L),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto a]\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i})&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ_i^{|\\mathfrak M|}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\{\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{n_{i,j}}:\n\\mathfrak M,s[\\vec x_j\\mapsto\\vec a]\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi_j\\}\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\right)=1,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\theta&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\theta)\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)}),\\\\\nu(\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j&lt;m_i}))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle8,i,\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle\\operatorname{idx}(x_{j,k})\\rangle_{k&lt;n_{i,j}}),u(\\varphi_j)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;m_i}\\right)\\right\\rangle\\right),\\\\\ng_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq u(\\varphi)\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}}(L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)},\n&amp;\\models_{\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q},L}&amp;\\coloneqq\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条仅补齐原量词不完备性命题所用的有限扩展语法。有限且可编码的语法不蕴含语义可判定，也不蕴含存在完备的有效演算；后者由独立的演算接口承担。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-generalized-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"1a5df6cf30c97026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-generalized-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下式定义 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}$、自由变量、句子及满足关系。原子、否定、合取、全称量词的语义递归与 [[67-df-satisfaction]] 完全相同，但递归子式取扩展公式。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g_{L(\\vec Q)}$ 使用 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的树编码并按下式增加标签 $8$；$g_L$ 的旧节点代码不变。$u$ 是相应未加外层类型标签的树编码；$\\operatorname{idx}(v_k)=k$。有效编码部分仅用于有限 PR 可编码签名，不要求 $Q_i$ 的语义可计算。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec n_i=\\langle n_{i,j}\\rangle_{j<m_i}","display":false},{"tex":"m_i\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"Q_i\\in\\mathrm{GenQuant}_{\\vec n_i}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j<m_i})","display":false},{"tex":"8","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_{i,j}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}","display":false},{"tex":"g_{L(\\vec Q)}","display":false},{"tex":"8","display":false},{"tex":"g_L","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{idx}(v_k)=k","display":false},{"tex":"Q_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j<m_i})&\\coloneqq\\langle8,i,\\langle(\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)\\rangle_{j<m_i}\\rangle,\\\\\nY_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Atom}_L,\\\\\nY_{h+1}&\\coloneqq Y_h\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in Y_h\\}\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in Y_h\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in Y_h\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j<m_i}):i\\in I\\land\n\\langle\\vec x_j\\rangle_{j<m_i}\\in\\prod_{j<m_i}\\mathrm{Var}_L^{n_{i,j}}\\land\\vec\\varphi\\in Y_h^{m_i}\n\\land\\forall j<m_i\\ \\mathrm{Distinct}_L(\\vec x_j)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{h\\in\\mathbb N}Y_h,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\alpha)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_L(\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Atom}_L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\neg\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\forall x\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j<m_i}))&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{j<m_i}\\bigl(\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi_j)\\setminus\\{x_{j,k}:k<n_{i,j}\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)}&\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}:\\mathrm{free}_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\alpha&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s\\models_L\\alpha\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Atom}_L),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\neg\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\forall x\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto a]\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j<m_i})&\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ_i^{|\\mathfrak M|}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\{\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak M|^{n_{i,j}}:\n\\mathfrak M,s[\\vec x_j\\mapsto\\vec a]\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\varphi_j\\}\\right\\rangle_{j<m_i}\\right)=1,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\theta&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}\\theta)\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)}),\\\\\nu(\\mathsf Q_i((\\vec x_j,\\varphi_j)_{j<m_i}))&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle8,i,\n\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{enc}\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{enc}(\\langle\\operatorname{idx}(x_{j,k})\\rangle_{k<n_{i,j}}),u(\\varphi_j)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\right\\rangle_{j<m_i}\\right)\\right\\rangle\\right),\\\\\ng_{L(\\vec Q)}(\\varphi)&\\coloneqq u(\\varphi)\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L(\\vec Q)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}}(L)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\vec Q)},\n&\\models_{\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q},L}&\\coloneqq\\models_{L(\\vec Q)}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4891,"backlinks":[{"id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Lambda=L_A(\\vec Q)$ 取 [[67-df-quantifier-language]]，$g_\\Lambda$ 为其固定有效单射编码；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\Lambda$。"},{"id":"7fdea8f95f2861a9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"589664f33390c7ce","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"eec586bbe9318717","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\vec Q$ 是 [[67-df-quantifier-language]] 的固定有限广义量词族；单量词时写 $\\mathcal L(Q)=\\mathcal L_{\\langle Q\\rangle}$，一般写 $\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}$。"},{"id":"0485e18b7419ccd1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$q<\\omega$，$\\vec Q$ 是有限广义量词族，各量词及元数表取 [[67-df-quantifier-language]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-quantifier-language]] — Finite Generalized-Quantifier Syntax and Semantics。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-quantifier-language]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-quantifier-language]]"}],"outgoing":["1a5df6cf30c97026","2035a1f4d72e7df9","bc53ba723358facc","a329235da6144513","e5558885fabd8e01"]}